  \verse{8:3} I came unto the prophetess%
  \ed{prophet's wife. Also, the old footnote.}
  and she conceived and bare a son. The \lord\ said unto me, ``Name him Maher-shalal-hash-baz,%%
  \verse{8:4} for before the child knows to call, `Dad, Mom,' someone shall take away the wealth of Damascus and the spoil of Samaria from before the king of Assyria.''%%
